<section class="section-soft">
<div class="wrap split">
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">Arrivals at MIA</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>MIA's terminal layout and pickup zones change by airline and concourse. Your flight is tracked from wheels-down, and your chauffeur confirms pickup once you're through the process for your arrival type:</p>
<ul class="points" style="margin-top:14px">
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>Domestic arrivals</b> — met curbside at baggage claim, typically the faster of the two.</span></li>
<li><i class="mark"></i><span><b>International arrivals</b> — met past customs and baggage; the extra processing time is tracked and built into the pickup plan, not treated as a delay.</span></li>
</ul>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:40px">To Aventura, Brickell &amp; PortMiami</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>MIA–Aventura/Sunny Isles typically runs 30-40 minutes outside peak hours. MIA–Brickell and Downtown run closer to 20-25 minutes. MIA–PortMiami for a same-day cruise connection runs roughly 15-20 minutes. Exact timing confirmed at booking based on your destination.</p>
</div>
<div class="prose reveal">
<h2 class="h2">Fixed quote, confirmed first</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Every MIA transfer is quoted at a fixed price before the trip, tolls and standard wait time included. No surge pricing, no reassigned driver mid-trip.</p>
<h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:40px">Also serving</h2>
<div class="rule"></div>
<p>Connecting from MIA to a cruise departure? We also cover <a href="airport-transfers.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">FLL and DJT transfers →</a>, plus PortMiami and Port Everglades cruise pickups.</p>
<p style="margin-top:16px">Weighing Uber against a pre-booked pickup at MIA? See our <a href="blog-private-chauffeur-vs-rideshare.html" style="color:#B8912E;text-decoration:underline;font-weight:500">private chauffeur vs. rideshare comparison →</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<section class="section-soft" style="padding-top:0">
<div class="wrap"><div class="feat-img reveal" style="aspect-ratio:16/9"><picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="suburban-front.avif" /><img src="suburban-front.webp" alt="Onyx Executive Miami Chevrolet Suburban for Miami International Airport transfers" width="1100" height="1467" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></picture></div></div>
